{"branch":"신중동점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">신중동점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-c864a532b32a464b.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"신중동점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-c864a532b32a464b.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>경기 부천시 원미구 조마루로291번길 25 센터프라자 405호, 406호</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 지하철</h3><ul class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-line\">수도권 7호선</span><span>신중동역</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>한양아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>한양아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>계남중학교</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>기업은행.위브더스테이트5단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>위브더스테이트5단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">6</span><span>농협중앙회</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">7</span><span>농협중앙회</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">8</span><span>그린타운앞.유베이스</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">9</span><span>계남중학교</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">10</span><span>금호한양상가.유베이스</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">11</span><span>신중동역2번출구.원미경찰서.롯데백화점</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><dl class=\"kd-buses\"><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">일반</span></dt><dd><span>5-4</span><span>23-2</span><span>6</span><span>60-1</span><span>61</span><span>66</span><span>52</span><span>70-3</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type